        "text": "Consider the following: \nI. \t\nInfringement of the Fundamental Rights\nII. \t  Outside the competence of the authority \nwhich has framed it\nIII. \t  Repugnant to the constitutional provisions\nA law can be challenged in the Supreme Court on \nhow many of the above grounds?",
